JsVVGSd71o94HBAbSsQ1jg-wSBqGnuJKukvinrAaKO2g&oe=6A9ED4C4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pwxF88PNXooQ7kNvwEajD0S&_nc_oc=AdoJQpF4kM2V3HPaocpMfGB7Sl_XNAN2TDfMr6jmtpxk__4A8BQxSvIP8zgCAVn0I04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLlVrLo3bwUYzUXK6ApBHTykt5hk1uYjQPKZn2vWLz-VQ&oe=6A9EB962"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kyFT6yv8oaMQ7kNvwGae_YN&_nc_oc=AdoU4ULttCn61A3BpQSyUjPjR9OUXUvmJ6a-jfnR6SuHNy9URIZH-vK7QBJwE0uZFxw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQw3TzO6Fo6uafEIP5A2z1kbGoL-8pU3-GHUE-jYIuDQ&oe=6A9EDBB3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ptFLZBBesRoQ7kNvwGlb51n&_nc_oc=AdopYQUAwrrTBNVddDwgLg_QL0QXa7yqaZ2aDGmyGMsHdM20xjUFvAx_6Uy0PAANoRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLyiD5tnatuBRQQsm9uVb1PEdfwZsXKk3H4pSMheOYFQw&oe=6A9EDAAF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h953akQyyo8Q7kNvwH50OAF&_nc_oc=AdqdMhSr-AWxFdtp2Vf9tqf5rd6eE2TKtYHQu-HmRP3Ug6HfHYy_oTtlmseJ6pvW1rc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIBwbzGjSI9X8itQkqIEVw2OYKQA3D7-F2fDpTgjfPU1w&oe=6A9ED6A5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-2ImqKDqwOoQ7kNvwGts1nC&_nc_oc=AdoF1DMnXF8Xp1EAFmaPLmLNYBkGCNYbyP0rwrmXFOwuknHcBB4IYhsPJbWvHRzw6Ik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJmi67SQ_xYA0eDbscDVYldaxucPuNXuu8g0nPYkPucmA&oe=6A9ED58D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hx5dBWluBAkQ7kNvwEWmC0C&_nc_oc=AdqEvZeztIWn67X3IAWLiLtmVP0tSGeWNHf2PqFeM7vDVGSp9JvsvKDiNdaFW3wnGrg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=